          <title>Yankees rally with 2 outs in 9th inning and beat Braves 3-2 in 10 after long rain delay</title>
          <description><![CDATA[Ben Rice ripped a tying single off the right-field fence with two outs in the ninth inning and Ryan McMahon hit a game-winning sacrifice fly in the 10th as the New York Yankees rallied past the Atlanta Braves 3-2 in a rain-delayed game that ended after midnight.]]></description>
          <guid>https://majordigest.com/sports/2026/08/08/yankees-rally-with-2-outs-in-9th-inning-and-beat-braves-3-2-in-10-after-long-rain-delay/</guid>
